---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, contact } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={site.description}>
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>David Theidel is a physicist working in quantum optics.</p>
    <p>
      Since March 2026 he has been a postdoctoral researcher at the Collège de
      France in Paris. As a member of the JEIP Quantum Photonics team of Alexei
      Ourjoumtsev, he works on Rydberg-assisted quantum engineering of light.
    </p>
    <p>
      He completed his PhD at the Institut Polytechnique de Paris in 2025. His
      thesis, carried out at the Laboratoire d’Optique Appliquée of the École
      polytechnique, concerned the quantum optical properties of high-harmonic
      generation in semiconductors.
    </p>
    <p>Before moving to Paris he studied physics at Leibniz University Hannover.</p>
    <p>
      His interests include ultrafast optics, non-classical states of light,
      photon statistics, and collective light–matter interaction.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Contact</h2>
    <ul class="contact">
      <li>{contact.email}</li>
      <li><a href={contact.scholar} rel="me noopener">Google Scholar</a></li>
      <li><a href={contact.orcid} rel="me noopener">ORCID</a></li>
      <li><a href={contact.linkedin} rel="me noopener">LinkedIn</a></li>
      <li><a href={contact.bluesky} rel="me noopener">Bluesky</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding-top: 3.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .prose {
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .contact {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
